OL,3,AStar-studded MacGowan tribute album
OL,4,Agave grieving wife purpose
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the day of Shane MacGowan's funeral,
OL,7,Fhis heartbroken wife found comfort in
OL,8,Fthe same thing that moved and
OL,9,Fcaptivated the rest of the world that
OL,10,Fafternoon - the music that filled a
OL,11,Fparish church in Nenagh, County
OL,12,FTipperary.
OL,14,FMundy and Camille O'Sullivan performed
OL,15,FHaunted. Nick Cave sang A Rainy Night
OL,16,Fin Soho. And Glen Hansard and Lisa
OL,17,FO'Neil led mourners in a send-off
OL,18,Frendition of Fairytale of New York.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
