OL,3,AStar-studded MacGowan tribute album
OL,4,Agave grieving wife purpose
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought, well, if we just got all
OL,7,Fthe people who were at the funeral on a
OL,8,Frecord, that'd be something pretty
OL,9,Fspecial," Victoria Mary Clarke told BBC
OL,10,FNews NI.
OL,12,FOn Friday, three years after her
OL,13,Fhusband's death, that idea came to
OL,14,Ffruition with the release of 20th
OL,15,FCentury Paddy.
